  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えええええー！？
ば、バイトじゃなかったの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eeeehhhh!? So you
didn't want the job...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごめんなさい。
あたし、はやとちりで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sorry. I kind of jumped
to conclusions there...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいですよ。
結構面白かったし、充実感もあったし
今日のバイト代まで頂いちゃったし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's fine. It was really interesting,
and it felt pretty fulfilling, too,
and you even paid me for it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そお？
えへへ、そう言ってくれると助かるな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, okay... Ehehe,
thanks for saying that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>普段気にしてなかった、
ウェイトレスさんの大変さも
とっても勉強になりました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I never really paid it much
mind before, so I learned how
hard it is to be a waitress, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もしなんでしたら
お手伝いに来ますよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you ever need me
again, I could come back?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええええええ！
ホントに！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh!? Really!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ううっ、&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃん、
いい子だよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wow, &lt;Mel&gt;, you're such a great kid!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいのか？　&lt;Mel&gt;。
んなコト言って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You sure about this, &lt;Mel&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん。これもなりきり士の
お仕事だし、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yup. This is also the job
of a Roleplayer, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとう！
じゃあ気が向いたら
また声かけてね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you! Then, come by
and talk to me whenever
you're feeling up to it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ！　本当に
都合のいいときでいいから、ね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah! Only when it's convenient
for you, of course~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
